"Uro-bor, called Grandma-Grandma, is an old woman of the bor family with a tattooed chin."
"She supervised Tass-ovekondo's household since before Earth knew Artonans existed."
"Tass-ovekondo gave her a bound wand, which is hers until she dies."
"Her family, generations of assistants, left the village in the Here-to-There."
"Her son is Gorol-bor."
"Olget broke her wand; Kon repaired it, and the bors were kept from learning of it."
